        "created_at": "2013-03-08T16:50:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a question about savage mana the card states whenever haka destroys a TARGET you put it under this card does that mean that if haka killed the Opetative that she would go under savage mana and if so would that mean that the chairman would not receive the damage boost she gives when incapacitated since she is no longer in the game?&nbsp;</p>",
